WEBVTT

00:07:29.550 --> 00:07:30.976
OK, keep it there.

00:07:31.000 --> 00:07:34.439
Be aware of the sensations, don't say
anything, don't open your eyes, OK.

00:07:42.976 --> 00:07:44.357
Did you feel anything, there?

00:07:44.381 --> 00:07:46.007
Nicole: Yes.
KB: What did you feel?

00:07:46.031 --> 00:07:47.063
Nicole: Three --

00:07:47.087 --> 00:07:49.110
KB: Like a tickling sensation?
Nicole: Yes.

00:07:49.134 --> 00:07:50.976
KB: Can you show us where?

00:07:51.000 --> 00:07:52.976
OK, excellent. Open your eyes.

00:07:53.000 --> 00:07:54.023
I never touched you.

00:07:54.047 --> 00:07:57.581
I just touched his back,
and I just touched his arm.

00:07:57.605 --> 00:07:58.976
A voodoo experiment.